{"version":1,"content":"<p>林建明（大姐明）接受薛家燕、范振鋒及思敏主持的《開心大派對》訪問，親述8月一度傳出病重、差點演變成肺炎的經過，又大談胡楓昏迷4日、昔日《歡樂今宵》幕後趣事等。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:49.642118+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":79,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T08:07:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T04:58:02.331141+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.771179+00:00","content_hash":"a84e01fad7f64b9191fd2430937b5f2716ed8ed337d65a0e7ef0b34e5971d9fd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}